    "title": "Mobile Phone Storage Explorer",
    "description": "If you are looking for an easy and simple file manager for your android device, Mobile Phone Storage Explorer is a better choice! This file management application is designed to help you manage the files of your phone and provide you with browsing multiple types of files.\r\nThe main feature is as follows:\r\n- Internal storage file browsing: You can easily browse the storage space of the device, and the intuitive application interface allows you to easily view the file to ensure that you can find the required content in a short time.\r\n- File classification: You can view the corresponding file content according to the file category, such as images, video, audio, download files, etc.",
